# Main Product Vision

Tripistic is not just another booking system.

Tripistic should become:

> An AI-native growth and operations platform for independent tour guides and small tour operators.

The product must combine:

* Booking engine
* Availability management
* Tour/package management
* Payments
* Deposits and installments
* Digital waivers
* Guide/staff scheduling
* Customer CRM
* Automated communication
* OTA/channel sync foundation
* AI Growth Dashboard
* AI booking agent foundation
* AI itinerary/package builder foundation
* AI marketing/content assistant foundation
* Compliance-ready data structure

The main differentiator is:

> 0% direct booking commission + affordable subscription pricing + AI growth intelligence.

