# Product Architecture Assumption

Use a SaaS-ready multi-tenant architecture.

Recommended structure:

* Marketing site: Tripistic.com
* App: app.tripistic.com
* API: api.tripistic.com
* Optional AI gateway: ai.wpistic.cloud or ai.tripistic.com
* Optional future MCP: mcp.wpistic.cloud
* Optional future brain/RAG: brain.wpistic.cloud

Assume the app will support multiple workspaces/businesses.

Every core record must belong to:

* `workspace_id`
* `owner_id` or `created_by`
* proper timestamps
* status flags
* soft delete where needed

